		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  pg_buffercache]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=14897#p14897"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>QUand je cree l&#039;extension, j&#039;ai un message d&#039;erreur, quand je la drop j&#039;ai aussi un message d&#039;erreur :</p><p>DB600=# CREATE EXTENSION pg_buffercache;<br />ERROR:&#160; function &quot;pg_buffercache_pages&quot; already exists with same argument types<br />DB600=# DROP EXTENSION pg_buffercache;<br />ERROR:&#160; extension &quot;pg_buffercache&quot; does not exist<br />DB600=#</p>]]></content>
